# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment / build artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Scratch renders, contact sheets and diagnostic dumps produced while
# developing. Nothing here is an input to training or evaluation.
out/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party imagery that we are NOT licensed to redistribute
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# MIIC (Microscopic Images of Integrated Circuits, Huang et al., ICIP 2021) is
# copyright and licensed for non-commercial research use only. It was used
# here solely to MEASURE calibration statistics (edge-contrast ratios, noise
# floors) that informed the renderer's parameters. No model is trained on it
# and no pixel of it ships in this repository. See docs/SEM_CALIBRATION_AND_
# LITERATURE.md for what was measured and how.
data/reference/
data/miic_*
*_miic_*.png

# Archives belonging to a different problem statement (PS-01, KLA image
# restoration). Not ours to redistribute and not used by this project.
data/*.rar

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large generated image sets
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The generator is deterministic: `generate_dataset.py --seeds-file seeds.txt`
# reconstructs these byte-identically, which is verified. The manifests
# (labels.csv), the seed lists and the dataset metadata ARE tracked, so every
# reported number stays auditable without carrying ~4.8 GB of PNGs.
#
# data/curated30 and data/val_resize60 ship their images in full, so the repo
# is runnable and inspectable straight after clone.
data/train/images/
data/train/pairs/
data/eval200/images/
data/eval200/pairs/

# Intermediate training caches (multi-GB memory-mapped tensors)
*.mmap

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Working notes kept out of the published record
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
SEMICON_HANDOFF*.md

# Superseded slide decks (only the submitted deck is tracked)
DriftSense_AppliedMaterials_PS02.pptx
TheTGuys_PS02.pptx
TheTGuys_PS02_FINAL.pptx
TheTGuys_PS02_clean.pptx
TheTGuys_PS02_official.pptx

# Intermediate training outputs. The four documented checkpoints in
# driftmatch/checkpoints/ (best + three ablation variants) are tracked; the
# per-run scratch copies are not.
driftmatch/checkpoints_gen/
driftmatch/checkpoints_new/
driftmatch/checkpoints/last.pt

data/_demo/
data/_seedscan/

# 31 Aug larger-training-set task: regeneratable from their recorded seeds
# (900000 / 950000 / 910000), so not tracked -- see PHASE2_RESEARCH_NOTES.md.
data/p2train8k/
data/p2calib300/
data/p2eval100/
data/p2test150/

# Fourier-Mellin task (docs/TEAMMATE_TASK_FOURIER_MELLIN.md): regeneratable
# from their recorded seeds (810500 / 810600 / 810000).
data/fmt_calib20/
data/fmt_calib60/
data/fmt_test200/

# Set C absent-pair fix: fresh rejection test set, regeneratable from seed 960000.
data/p2reject_test300/

# Noise-coverage task (speckle + salt-and-pepper): regeneratable from seeds
# 970000 / 980000. checkpoints_speckle is a per-run scratch checkpoint dir.
data/p2train_speckle4k/
data/p2eval_speckle100/
driftmatch/checkpoints_speckle/

# Real organizer validation data (shared privately by the mentor) -- must
# never be committed to this public repo. Local-only, used for diagnosis.
data/organizer_sample/

# Training data generated from the organizers' own Phase 2 generator (new seeds,
# randomised poses -- NOT their 20 sample pairs). Large, regeneratable.
data/amp_train/
driftmatch/checkpoints_amp/
AMP_Phase 2 material/
Dataset_AMP_Phase 2/
data/amp_train2/
data/amp_holdout/
data/amp_all/
amp_*_log.txt
amp_orchestrator.txt
amp_experiment_log.txt

# Stale Phase 1 demo video (23 MB); Phase 2 requires no video per the task deck.
driftsense-demo.mp4
*.mp4
